    "detailed_description": "<i>Inn Mage</i> is a strategy game with role-playing and management simulation elements. Player need to use magic creatively to run an inn and deal with competitor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">If</h2>What you want to play is a typical inn management game. The <i>Inn Mage</i> will disappoint you because:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Food: only roast meat and beer.<br></li><li>Furniture: only table, bench, bed, oven.<br></li><li>Customer: you don't need to take care of them. You just don't attack them.<br></li><li>Employee: you can only summon skeletons as employees by using the magic scroll.<br></li><li>Competitor: It really exists and needs you to deal with it.<br></li><li>Magic scroll: you need to use magic scroll creatively to win, rather than just rely on expanding the inn.<br></li><li>Combat: just like other ARPGs.<br></li><li>Steal: just like other RPGs.</li></ul>",
